; A value `if` whose wider arm does not fit the declared target narrows, and
; a narrowing write takes its cast -- judged on the arms since 2026-11-10
; (Planner.settle_value_arms#). Before, the emitter met an i32 arm beside an
; i64 one, built no value and dropped the binding: `v` read 0 at rc 0.
; xfail: the initializer narrows int into i32

function f(c: i32, k: i32, big: int) returns i32
{
    let v: i32 if c > k: k else big
    v + 100
}

if f(9, 7, 5) = 107
    print "PASS"
